  'suggestPlaces',
  'suggestPlacesInBoundary',
  'searchPlaces',
  'searchPlacesInBoundary',
  // The live distance-matrix call (M31): the contract's
  // `MapSdk::calculate_distance_matrix`, answered by the active provider's
  // `DistanceMatrixProvider`. Native-only in the contract today; this wasm
